{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dropcore</i></strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced 2D multiplayer arena game focused on physics-based knockback combat. There\u2019s no health \u2014 only chaos, gravity, and pure skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, grab your pistol, and dive into unpredictable battles where your only goal is to throw your enemies off the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map has unique gameplay mechanics:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Custom gravity settings  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic wind forces  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speed and jump modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect a wide range of weapon classes \u2014 from pistols to shotguns to experimental tech \u2014 each with different recoil, fire rate, and knockback strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick both passive and active abilities to match your playstyle: dash through enemies, rewind time, launch shockwaves and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 6 game modes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Supports 2\u20134 players per match  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Strategic wepaon class + skill system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Play with friends via direct Steam invite  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love chaotic PvP, physics-based mayhem, and outplaying opponents with movement \u2014 <strong><i>Dropcore</i></strong> is your next addiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gravity Wins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3726110/080d9a43822b18d474e0be2a98390c7ea76ba49f.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726110?t=1748876031","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726110/82b65eda96498d79439a1d6e8f01cbf093963537/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748876031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726110/824e8165536231fb31dba275a2f4f85ad6419491/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748876031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726110/824e8165536231fb31dba275a2f4f85ad6419491/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748876031","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dropcore</i></strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced 2D multiplayer arena game focused on physics-based knockback combat. There\u2019s no health \u2014 only chaos, gravity, and pure skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, grab your pistol, and dive into unpredictable battles where your only goal is to throw your enemies off the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map has unique gameplay mechanics:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Custom gravity settings  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic wind forces  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speed and jump modifiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect a wide range of weapon classes \u2014 from pistols to shotguns to experimental tech \u2014 each with different recoil, fire rate, and knockback strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick both passive and active abilities to match your playstyle: dash through enemies, rewind time, launch shockwaves and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 6 game modes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Supports 2\u20134 players per match  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Strategic wepaon class + skill system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Play with friends via direct Steam invite  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph